# Build context filter for apps/web/Dockerfile.portal ONLY (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; other builds are
# unaffected). ALLOWLIST: the portal sources and the shared libs are the only
# image inputs - the workstation's node_modules / .next / .venv / vendor /
# .git never leave the machine, and NO .env* file is ever sent (the
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values come from build args, never from a workstation env).
*
!apps/web
!libs
apps/web/*/node_modules
apps/web/*/.next
apps/web/*/.env
apps/web/*/.env.*
libs/**/node_modules
